Beyond garden work, the company takes on structural building construction and outdoor entertainment areas, offering what it calls turnkey solutions, where a client hands over a brief and the company manages the project through to a finished, functional space. That combination of landscaping and construction services under one company lets Ecoscape take on both residential garden upgrades and larger commercial landscape and building projects without bringing in separate contractors for each trade.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://ecoscapelandscapingdesigns.com/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'ecoscape-landscape-construction-pretoria-east-bryntirion' AND description = 'Ecoscape Landscape Construction is a landscaping and construction company serving Pretoria East and the wider Gauteng area, offering garden design, paving, retaining walls, outdoor entertainment areas and full construction projects. The company says it has over 24 years of experience and has completed more than 700 garden projects.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
